<section class="section services" id="services">
  <div class="dart-container">

    <div class="section__header services__header">
      <div class="services__header-text">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Услуги и цены</span>
        <h2>Выберите подходящий формат работы</h2>
        <p class="section__desc">
          Ниже — пример структуры услуг и стоимости. Замените названия, описания
          и цены на свои. Оставить заявку можно <a href="#booking">через форму</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="#booking" class="dart-btn dart-btn-primary services__header-cta">
        Оставить заявку
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <ul class="services__grid">
      {{#each services}}
      <li class="service-card{{#if this.popular}} service-card--popular{{/if}} reveal">
        {{#if this.popular}}
        <span class="service-card__badge">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-fire" aria-hidden="true"></i> Чаще всего выбирают
        </span>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="service-card__top">
          <span class="service-card__icon"><i class="{{this.icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <div class="service-card__head">
            <h3 class="service-card__title">{{this.title}}</h3>
            <span class="service-card__duration">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              {{this.duration}}
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="service-card__text">{{this.text}}</p>

        <div class="service-card__price">
          <span class="service-card__price-label">от</span>
          <span class="service-card__price-value">{{money this.price}}</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="service-card__prices">
          {{#each this.prices}}
          <li>
            <span class="service-card__size">{{tierAt @index}}</span>
            <span class="service-card__sum">{{money this}}</span>
          </li>
          {{/each}}
        </ul>

        <a href="#booking" class="dart-btn dart-btn-secondary service-card__cta"
           data-booking-service="{{this.title}}">
          Оставить заявку
        </a>
      </li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>

    <p class="services__note">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      {{serviceNote}}
    </p>

    <div class="services__bottom">
      <div class="services__bottom-text">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p>
          Не знаете, какой формат подойдёт? Опишите задачу — специалист подскажет
          на консультации <strong>бесплатно</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="services__bottom-actions">
        <a href="{{site.whatsapp}}" class="dart-btn dart-btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Спросить в WhatsApp
        </a>
        <a href="#booking" class="dart-btn dart-btn-outline">Оставить заявку</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
